Package: ragnar-view
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgtk4-layer-shell0
Maintainer: LieraOS
Description: Ragnar desktop icons layer (LieraOS)
 Rust/GTK4 replacement for the legacy ragnar-desktop-view: bottom
 layer-shell surface with ~/Desktop icons, mounts, trash, and the
 desktop context menus.
